{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snake: Secret Treasure reimagines the classic snake game as a modern puzzle-adventure experience.<br>Across 120 challenging levels, your logic, reflexes, and strategy will be pushed to the limit as you search for hidden treasures.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>120-Level Campaign</strong> \u2013 Divided into 8 themed worlds (Desert, Ice, Fire, and more).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048190/extras/dcfddd34a5f3c15fda09e818c40fa694.avif?t=1773153337\" width=1560 height=874 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progressive Challenges</strong> \u2013 Each section introduces new mechanics: a fire-breathing snake, Sokoban-style box pushing, invisible tail segments, speed changes, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048190/extras/e3636feb5445d72c3cc29700e8877478.avif?t=1773153337\" width=1560 height=876 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Treasure Hunt</strong> \u2013 Collect every gold piece without dying and reach the exit gate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048190/extras/c958c2d561fe1143191a47d2b16088e0.avif?t=1773153337\" width=1560 height=879 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Meets Modern</strong> \u2013 Nostalgia of the original snake combined with fresh puzzle and challenge mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready?<br>Collect all the treasures, overcome the toughest puzzles, and unlock the secrets of the snake!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com